// Row fields:
//   flavors      always equals variants.length (the count shown on cards)
//   variants     the sellable variants a buyer chooses between; one variant is
//                auto-selected, none means the product is sold as-is
//   sellUnit     what quantity 1 means, only when the product name states it
//                (e.g. "5-pack", "25-count box"); empty renders nothing
//   img          photo filename in ../assets/products, or null while a photo is
//                still needed. Resolved to a responsive set by ../lib/images.js.
//   description  written from the name, brand, department and variants only
//   sku          unique, stable code; quick reorder matches it exactly, and
//                variant codes append the variant slug (see ../lib/lines.js)

